                <div class="col-12 col-xl-6">
                    <div class="card p-3 h-100">
                        <h5 class="mb-1"><code>&lt;ph-badge&gt;</code></h5>
                        <p class="small text-body-secondary">Variants, sizes and pill shape.</p>
